'' A USING OF AN IMPORT DOES NOT REACH A SIBLING FILE (M22). a.tiko imports util and writes
'' 'using util'; b.tiko, which sorts after it, imports nothing and calls Foo bare. The files
'' are read as one unit, so the using was in effect for b.tiko and the program printed 42 42,
'' while b.tiko's 'util.Foo' was already TKO0743.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/modules/src/usingfile/leak.tiko -o tests/modules/usingfile-leak.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: leak/b.tiko(3,12): error TKO0743: 'foo' is not declared
